{"id":"vod_bf_4962","vodId":"4962","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"虫师","name_cn":"虫师","date":"2005-01-01","year":"2005","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-6/bd1b02b87edb6da02a00aa9253f1e824.jpg"},"summary":"“虫”既不是动物，也不是微生物，而是一种自然界中无处不在的力量，拥有独特的生命形态，偶尔和人类生命产生交汇，便生出一些奇妙的故事。但人们即使得知了“虫”的存在，大部分时候也不知如何应对，这便需要“虫师”出马。　　银古就是一位虫师，他一头银发，年纪尚轻，但已经半生游历，经过一个个山野、村庄，为人们解决“虫”的问题，通过和被“虫”困扰的人们接近，他也接近了许多故事。银古的游历像风一样，再惊心动魄的“虫”似乎都融化在水墨样的山峦叠嶂间，芸芸众生也是过眼云烟，淡淡的故事里没有哀伤只有静穆。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-09 23:27:26","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/chongshi/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/chongshi/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/chongshi/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/chongshi/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/chongshi/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/chongshi/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/chongshi/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/chongshi/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/chongshi/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/chongshi/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/chongshi/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/chongshi/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/chongshi/第13集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/chongshi/第14集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/chongshi/第15集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/ch